ovsdb: Read manager options when they are used

helpers.enable_connection_uri was a functools.partial that read the
[OVS] ovsdb_timeout and of_inactivity_probe options at import time.
neutron-ovn-agent imports it before parsing its configuration files,
so it always created the OVSDB manager with the default values.

Make it a function that reads the options on each call, keeping the
partial's other defaults and letting callers override any of them.

Related-Bug: #1868686
Prompt: a scan of neutron for values fixed at import time found this
partial; tracing imports against config parsing showed only the OVN
agent loads it too early.
